"Gramps, the Grandfather of Traits, is the god who reincarnated Syl and runs her powers."
"Gramps speaks as a kindly grandfather from a void with a wooden stool."
"Mother, the Mother of Magic, is the goddess behind Vee, and wants magic explored."
"Unc is the god behind Leon; he stutters, grants achievements, and was once a dungeon master."
"Gramps, Mother and Unc are allied through bribes and tricks, and bicker constantly."
"The gods feed on mortals' deeds and growth, and at times stir up events from boredom."
"The dragon that beat Juniper and the blood troll are reborn souls, [Experiments] like Syl."
"Syl killed the alicorn prince long ago, and the alicorns' vengeance was against her."
"Syl killed Amelia and Lewis in Azulean when they tried to frame Sylvain."
"Wiggles was a slime whose core Syl ate, which gave her light magic."
